---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="About">
<section class="route">
  <div class="wrap section">
    <p class="kicker">About</p>
    <h1 data-split>Two industries, one&nbsp;lesson.</h1>
    <p class="lede prose" style="margin-top:18px">Music taught me how people get paid for their work. Banking taught me how to build the rails. Both taught me to answer for what I ship.</p>

    <div class="dual-matrix rv">
      <div class="dual-col spot">
        <div class="dual-header">
          <div>
            <h3 class="dual-title">Inside a Licensed Bank</h3>
            <span class="dual-period">2021 &ndash; 2024 &middot; Rakuten Bank</span>
          </div>
          <span class="dual-badge">Tech Team Leader</span>
        </div>
        <div class="dual-rows">
          <div class="dual-row">
            <span class="dual-k">Team &amp; Scale</span>
            <span class="dual-v">Led <strong>9 engineers</strong> (5 BE, 2 FE, 2 Mobile) &amp; managed <strong>5 vendors</strong> (IBM, HSM, Telco).</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dual-row">
            <span class="dual-k">Governance</span>
            <span class="dual-v"><strong>100% on-time</strong> quarterly delivery. Built vendor review SOPs and cut onboarding time from 3 weeks to 2 days.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dual-row">
            <span class="dual-k">Compliance</span>
            <span class="dual-v">Delivered FSC KYC CDD/EDD re-verification, Mobile ID device binding, and closed <strong>15 PwC audit</strong> findings.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dual-row">
            <span class="dual-k">Core Lesson</span>
            <span class="dual-v">Requirements belong to regulators &amp; operations; zero tolerance for non-compliant states.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dual-col spot">
        <div class="dual-header">
          <div>
            <h3 class="dual-title">Solo Product Engineering</h3>
            <span class="dual-period">2025 &ndash; present &middot; LZpreneur O&Uuml;</span>
          </div>
          <span class="dual-badge">Founder &amp; Builder</span>
        </div>
        <div class="dual-rows">
          <div class="dual-row">
            <span class="dual-k">Team &amp; Scale</span>
            <span class="dual-v"><strong>Solo 0-to-1</strong>: Flutter iOS &amp; Android, web storefront, Cloud Functions backend on GCP.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dual-row">
            <span class="dual-k">Payments</span>
            <span class="dual-v"><strong>3 production rails</strong> (Stripe, Apple IAP, Google Play IAP) normalised into unified entitlement schema.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dual-row">
            <span class="dual-k">Traction</span>
            <span class="dual-v"><strong>350+ users</strong>, 100+ MAU, paying customers, <strong>$0 ad spend</strong> via organic SEO. 13 releases in 8 months.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dual-row">
            <span class="dual-k">Core Lesson</span>
            <span class="dual-v">Seeing the whole line: from user pain point to unit economics and maintenance cost.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="pullquote rv">
      <span class="pq-lead">Why this mix matters</span>
      <p>I learned rigor inside a licensed bank, and I learned speed by shipping my own product alone. So I can sit with your customer, figure out what they actually need, and turn it into software that passes an audit.</p>
    </blockquote>

    <div class="case-sec" style="margin-top:36px">
      <h2 class="rv">At a glance for recruiters &amp; hiring teams</h2>
      <table class="cheat-sheet rv">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Dimension</th>
            <th>Status &amp; Verification</th>
            <th>Details</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Target Role</strong></td>
            <td><span class="badge-pill">Forward Deployed Engineer</span></td>
            <td>Product Engineering, Integration Engineering, Solutions Architecture</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Relocation Targets</strong></td>
            <td><span class="badge-pill success">Open to Relocation</span></td>
            <td><span data-site="where">Dublin, Amsterdam, Tallinn, or EU remote</span> &middot; Open to customer travel &amp; on-site</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Work Authorization</strong></td>
            <td><span class="badge-pill">Employer Sponsorship</span></td>
            <td>Taiwanese national &middot; Qualifying ICT Degree (BBA IM) for <strong>Ireland Critical Skills Employment Permit (CSEP)</strong>, NL Highly Skilled Migrant, EE Residence</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Availability</strong></td>
            <td><span class="badge-pill success"><span data-site="notice">4 weeks</span></span></td>
            <td>Currently frontend engineer at FintechLife, Taipei &middot; Available for calls 09:00&ndash;20:00 IST</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Languages</strong></td>
            <td><span class="badge-pill">English &amp; Mandarin</span></td>
            <td>English (Full professional &middot; UK Master's from University of Liverpool) &middot; Mandarin (Native)</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="case-sec" style="margin-top:40px">
      <h2 class="rv">Where I have been</h2>
      <div class="vtl">
        <span class="vtl-rail" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span>
        <ol class="vtl-items">
          <li class="vtl-item now">
            <span class="vtl-year">2025<small>to now</small></span>
            <span class="vtl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span></span>
            <div class="vtl-body">
              <p class="vtl-role">Founder &amp; Product Engineer</p>
              <p class="vtl-org">LZpreneur O&Uuml;, Estonia (remote)</p>
              <p class="vtl-note">Course Kit and Vibe Code Home, built alongside full-time work.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="vtl-item now">
            <span class="vtl-year">2024<small>to now</small></span>
            <span class="vtl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span></span>
            <div class="vtl-body">
              <p class="vtl-role">Frontend Engineer</p>
              <p class="vtl-org">FintechLife, Taipei</p>
              <p class="vtl-note">PCI DSS payload encryption, a two-product monorepo consolidation, an AI-assisted development workflow, and the customer-facing developer portal.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="vtl-item">
            <span class="vtl-year">2024<small>Jun to Sep</small><span class="vtl-tag">Break</span></span>
            <span class="vtl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span></span>
            <div class="vtl-body">
              <p class="vtl-role">Working holiday, United Kingdom</p>
              <p class="vtl-org">UK Youth Mobility Scheme</p>
              <p class="vtl-note">Spent the last month of it working in London as a frontend engineer on a live gaming platform.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="vtl-item bank">
            <span class="vtl-year">2021<small>to 2024</small></span>
            <span class="vtl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span></span>
            <div class="vtl-body">
              <p class="vtl-role">Rakuten International Commercial Bank</p>
              <p class="vtl-org">Taiwan's first digital-only bank &middot; promoted after 18 months</p>
              <ol class="vtl-roles">
                <li>
                  <b>Tech Team Leader</b> <span class="vtl-when">2022 to 2024</span>
                  <p>Nine engineers and five vendors. First engineer on the bank's mobile app.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <b>Senior Frontend Engineer</b> <span class="vtl-when">2021 to 2022</span>
                  <p>KYC re-verification with an IBM vendor team, Mobile ID device binding, security hardening.</p>
                </li>
              </ol>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="vtl-item">
            <span class="vtl-year">2020<small>to 2021</small></span>
            <span class="vtl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span></span>
            <div class="vtl-body">
              <p class="vtl-role">Frontend Engineer</p>
              <p class="vtl-org">Shengsen Cloud Technology</p>
              <p class="vtl-note">On site at Far Eastern International Bank, delivering a logistics system.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="vtl-item edu">
            <span class="vtl-year">2019<small>to 2020</small><span class="vtl-tag">Study</span></span>
            <span class="vtl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span></span>
            <div class="vtl-body">
              <p class="vtl-role">MA Music Industry Studies</p>
              <p class="vtl-org">University of Liverpool, UK</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="vtl-item">
            <span class="vtl-year">2016<small>to 2019</small></span>
            <span class="vtl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span></span>
            <div class="vtl-body">
              <p class="vtl-role">Project Coordinator</p>
              <p class="vtl-org">Wistron ITS</p>
              <p class="vtl-note">On site at Foxconn H2U, on the member and admin platforms. Wrote 200+ manual and automated test cases, raising coverage by 30%.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="vtl-item">
            <span class="vtl-year">2015<small>to 2016</small></span>
            <span class="vtl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span></span>
            <div class="vtl-body">
              <p class="vtl-role">Software Engineer</p>
              <p class="vtl-org">Smart Catch Inc.</p>
              <p class="vtl-note">A parking payment system for New Taipei City, back end and front end, plus shared modules for a team of five.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="vtl-item edu">
            <span class="vtl-year">2011<small>to 2015</small><span class="vtl-tag">Study</span></span>
            <span class="vtl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span></span>
            <div class="vtl-body">
              <p class="vtl-role">BBA Information Management</p>
              <p class="vtl-org">Chihlee University of Technology, Taipei</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="case-sec">
      <h2 class="rv">Beyond code: Cross-domain transfer</h2>
      <p class="rv prose">In the middle of an engineering career I completed a master's in music industry studies at the University of Liverpool. Studying how work reaches audiences, who owns rights, and who gets paid turned out to be the exact conceptual foundation for software payment rails and entitlement architectures.</p>
      
      <div class="xwalk rv">
        <div class="xwalk-row xwalk-head">
          <span>Music industry</span>
          <span></span>
          <span>Fintech architecture</span>
        </div>
        <div class="xwalk-row">
          <b>Copyright splits</b>
          <span class="xwalk-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <b>Multi-party rights verification</b>
        </div>
        <div class="xwalk-row">
          <b>Mechanical licensing</b>
          <span class="xwalk-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <b>Distribution pipelines</b>
        </div>
        <div class="xwalk-row">
          <b>Royalty accounting</b>
          <span class="xwalk-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <b>Stripe, Apple and Google entitlement schema</b>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mini-grid rv">
        <a class="mini-card" href="/writing/music-industry-structure-and-careers">
          <h4>Industry Structure &amp; Careers &rarr;</h4>
          <p>The operational roles from A&amp;R to distribution.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="mini-card" href="/writing/music-copyright-royalty-streams-for-songwriters">
          <h4>Copyright &amp; 5 Royalty Streams &rarr;</h4>
          <p>Composition vs Master rights, sync &amp; mechanicals.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="mini-card" href="/writing/indie-artists-overseas-tour-guide">
          <h4>Overseas Tour Guide &rarr;</h4>
          <p>Agents, promoters, routing and budget execution.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="case-sec">
      <h2 class="rv">Right now</h2>
      <div class="status-radar rv">
        <div class="radar-card">
          <span class="r-tag"><span class="r-dot soon" aria-hidden="true"></span>Shipping Soon</span>
          <p class="r-val">Course Kit personal plan, mid September 2026.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="radar-card">
          <span class="r-tag"><span class="r-dot live" aria-hidden="true"></span>Current Full-time</span>
          <p class="r-val">Frontend engineering at FintechLife, Taipei &middot; Available in <span data-site="notice">4 weeks</span>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="radar-card">
          <span class="r-tag"><span class="r-dot live" aria-hidden="true"></span>Conversations</span>
          <p class="r-val">Talking to teams in <span data-site="citiesAnd">Dublin, Amsterdam and Tallinn</span> about Forward Deployed Engineer roles.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="links-line"><a href="mailto:lucychen.biz@gmail.com">lucychen.biz@gmail.com</a> &middot; <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/lucychen-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a> &middot; <a href="https://github.com/lucyc1715" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a> &middot; I reply within 24 hours.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Base>
